<title>FINLAND: PENOPE SELLS STARCKJOHANN STAKE.</title>
<headline>PENOPE SELLS STARCKJOHANN STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mechanical wood industry machinery wholesaler Penope Oy said on Wednesday it sold its 1.5 percent holding in hardware retailer Starckjohann Oy for 18.2 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Penope will receive an 8.4 million markka gain from the deal,&quot; Penope said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
